<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Automatic shoplifting Iconic RP</Major>
    <Description>Automatic shoplifting script for GTA V Iconic RP server

Resolution 1920x1080 
Aspect ratio: 4:3 

Stand infront of a shelve you can shoplift from in any 7/11 marked on the map and run this script to auto farm canisters 
Make sure you have full food and water so you don't die while AFK farming
Goof luck! 
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
